{
  "name": "FORMATION---Archive-Promotion",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FORMATION - Archive Promotion\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/formation-archive-promotion\n\n**Source:** RFC-023\n\n**Description:**\nArchive une promotion et publie un event pour que\nchatbot-core archive la structure Discord.\n\n**Input:**\n```json\n{\n  \"guild_id\": \"123456789\",\n  \"promotion_id\": \"uuid\"\n}\n```\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Valide les données d'entrée\n2. Appelle API PUT /promotions/{id}/archive\n3. Publie event `promotion.archived` vers Redis Stream\n4. Retourne le résultat",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0000",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "formation-archive-promotion",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0001",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "formation-archive-promotion"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// VALIDATE INPUT\n// ============================================\n\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst body = input.body || {};\nconst headers = input.headers || {};\n\n// Extract project_id from header\nconst projectId = headers['x-project-id'] || headers['X-Project-ID'] || 'default';\n\n// Required fields\nconst errors = [];\n\nif (!body.guild_id) errors.push('guild_id');\nif (!body.promotion_id) errors.push('promotion_id');\n\nif (errors.length > 0) {\n  return {\n    valid: false,\n    error: {\n      code: 400,\n      message: `Paramètres requis manquants: ${errors.join(', ')}`,\n      status: 'BAD_REQUEST'\n    }\n  };\n}\n\nreturn {\n  valid: true,\n  project_id: projectId,\n  data: {\n    guild_id: body.guild_id,\n    promotion_id: body.promotion_id\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0002",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-valid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0003",
      "name": "Input Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.error) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0004",
      "name": "Response Error 400",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        860,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "={{ $env.API_URL }}/api/promotions/{{ $json.data.promotion_id }}/archive",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Project-ID",
              "value": "={{ $json.project_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0005",
      "name": "API Archive Promotion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        200
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// CHECK API RESPONSE\n// ============================================\n\nconst apiResponse = $input.first().json;\nconst inputData = $('Validate Input').first().json;\n\n// Check for API error\nif (apiResponse.error || apiResponse.statusCode >= 400) {\n  return {\n    success: false,\n    error: {\n      code: apiResponse.statusCode || 500,\n      message: apiResponse.message || apiResponse.error || 'API error',\n      status: 'API_ERROR'\n    }\n  };\n}\n\n// Success\nconst promotion = apiResponse.data || apiResponse;\n\nreturn {\n  success: true,\n  promotion_id: inputData.data.promotion_id,\n  guild_id: inputData.data.guild_id,\n  archived_at: promotion.archived_at || new Date().toISOString()\n};"
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0006",
      "name": "Check API Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-api-success",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0007",
      "name": "API Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.error) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": "={{ $json.error.code || 500 }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0008",
      "name": "Response API Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// PREPARE REDIS EVENT\n// ============================================\n\nconst data = $input.first().json;\n\n// Préparer l'event pour Redis Stream\nconst event = {\n  type: 'promotion.archived',\n  timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n  guild_id: data.guild_id,\n  data: {\n    promotion_id: data.promotion_id,\n    archived_at: data.archived_at\n  }\n};\n\nreturn {\n  promotion_id: data.promotion_id,\n  guild_id: data.guild_id,\n  stream_name: `formation:events:${data.guild_id}`,\n  event: event\n};"
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0009",
      "name": "Prepare Redis Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1520,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "xAdd",
        "key": "={{ $json.stream_name }}",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldName": "event",
              "fieldValue": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.event) }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0010",
      "name": "Publish Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.redis",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1740,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "redis": {
          "id": "2idv3VKZ91q5gOnz",
          "name": "Redis account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// PREPARE SUCCESS RESPONSE\n// ============================================\n\nconst data = $('Prepare Redis Event').first().json;\n\nreturn {\n  success: true,\n  message: 'Promotion archivée avec succès',\n  promotion_id: data.promotion_id,\n  archived_at: data.event.data.archived_at,\n  event_published: true\n};"
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0011",
      "name": "Format Success Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1960,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "formation-archive-0012",
      "name": "Response Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
